{"kind":"html","caption":"动画按深度优先顺序访问示例树，并维护从根到当前节点的前缀和。若当前前缀和为 S，只需统计此前出现过多少个 S−8；每次命中就对应一条以当前节点结尾的向下路径。示例中依次找到 5→3、5→2→1 和 −3→11，共 3 条路径。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>路径总和 III 可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}\n.tree{display:grid;gap:4px;font-size:10px}\n.level{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,minmax(0,1fr));gap:3px;align-items:stretch}\n.node{min-height:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s}\n.node .value,.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}\n.node .name{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;line-height:1.1}\n.node.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.node.current .value{color:#fff}\n.node.path{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;opacity:.85}\n.root{grid-column:4/6}.n5{grid-column:2/4}.nm3{grid-column:6/8}.n3a{grid-column:1/3}.n2{grid-column:3/5}.n11{grid-column:7/9}.n3b{grid-column:1/2}.nm2{grid-column:2/3}.n1{grid-column:4/5}\n.branches{color:#8d8d8d;text-align:center;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px}\n.formula{padding:6px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;background:#2d2d2d;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.formula strong{color:#3794ff}\n.chain{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin:6px 0 8px}\n.chip{min-width:36px;padding:4px 6px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;text-align:center;font-size:10px}\n.chip .small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.chip.hit{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.stat{flex:1 1 80px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.stat span{display:block;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.stat b{display:block;margin-top:2px;font:600 13px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.stat.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.stat.active b{color:#fff}\n.message{min-height:44px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n.message .found{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot{height:3px;flex:1;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px}\n.dot.on{background:#3794ff}\n.legend{margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>前缀和沿树向下计数</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">targetSum = <span class=\"mono\">8</span></p>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>示例树</h2>\n<div class=\"tree\">\n<div class=\"level\"><div class=\"node root\" data-id=\"a\"><span class=\"value\">10</span><span class=\"name\">根</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"branches\">╱　　　╲</div>\n<div class=\"level\">\n<div class=\"node n5\" data-id=\"b\"><span class=\"value\">5</span><span class=\"name\">左</span></div>\n<div class=\"node nm3\" data-id=\"c\"><span class=\"value\">−3</span><span class=\"name\">右</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"branches\">╱╲　　╲</div>\n<div class=\"level\">\n<div class=\"node n3a\" data-id=\"d\"><span class=\"value\">3</span></div>\n<div class=\"node n2\" data-id=\"e\"><span class=\"value\">2</span></div>\n<div class=\"node n11\" data-id=\"f\"><span class=\"value\">11</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"branches\">╱╲　╲</div>\n<div class=\"level\">\n<div class=\"node n3b\" data-id=\"g\"><span class=\"value\">3</span></div>\n<div class=\"node nm2\" data-id=\"h\"><span class=\"value\">−2</span></div>\n<div class=\"node n1\" data-id=\"i\"><span class=\"value\">1</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"legend\">蓝：当前访问；命中时路径高亮。</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2>搜索状态</h2>\n<div class=\"formula mono\">查找此前的 <strong>S − 8</strong></div>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div>\n<div class=\"stats\">\n<div class=\"stat\"><span>前缀和 S</span><b id=\"sum\">0</b></div>\n<div class=\"stat\"><span>需 S−8</span><b id=\"need\">−8</b></div>\n<div class=\"stat\" id=\"countBox\"><span>路径数</span><b id=\"count\">0</b></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"message\" id=\"message\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\n  const steps = [\n    {node:'a', chain:[['10',10]], sum:10, need:2, count:0, text:'访问 10。此前没有前缀和 2，本步没有新路径。'},\n    {node:'b', chain:[['10',10],['5',15]], sum:15, need:7, count:0, text:'继续向下访问 5。此前没有前缀和 7。'},\n    {node:'d', chain:[['10',10],['5',15],['3',18]], sum:18, need:10, count:1, path:['b','d'], hitIndex:0, text:'找到旧前缀和 10，删去它之前的部分，得到路径 5 → 3。', found:true},\n    {node:'g', chain:[['10',10],['5',15],['3',18],['3',21]], sum:21, need:13, count:1, text:'继续访问叶子 3。此前没有前缀和 13，随后回溯。'},\n    {node:'h', chain:[['10',10],['5',15],['3',18],['−2',16]], sum:16, need:8, count:1, text:'转向节点 −2。此前没有前缀和 8，随后回溯。'},\n    {node:'e', chain:[['10',10],['5',15],['2',17]], sum:17, need:9, count:1, text:'访问节点 2。此前没有前缀和 9。'},\n    {node:'i', chain:[['10',10],['5',15],['2',17],['1',18]], sum:18, need:10, count:2, path:['b','e','i'], hitIndex:0, text:'再次找到旧前缀和 10，得到路径 5 → 2 → 1。', found:true},\n    {node:'c', chain:[['10',10],['−3',7]], sum:7, need:-1, count:2, text:'左子树完成后回溯，转向 −3。此前没有前缀和 −1。'},\n    {node:'f', chain:[['10',10],['−3',7],['11',18]], sum:18, need:10, count:3, path:['c','f'], hitIndex:0, text:'找到旧前缀和 10，得到路径 −3 → 11。三条路径全部找到。', found:true}\n  ];\n\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  steps.forEach(() => { const d=document.createElement('div'); d.className='dot'; progress.appendChild(d); });\n  let index = 0;\n\n  function render(step, stepIndex) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(n => n.classList.remove('current','path'));\n    const current = document.querySelector('[data-id=\"' + step.node + '\"]');\n    if (current) current.classList.add('current');\n    (step.path || []).forEach(id => document.querySelector('[data-id=\"' + id + '\"]').classList.add('path'));\n\n    const chain = document.getElementById('chain');\n    chain.innerHTML = '';\n    step.chain.forEach((item, i) => {\n      const chip = document.createElement('div');\n      chip.className = 'chip' + (step.found && i === step.hitIndex ? ' hit' : '');\n      chip.innerHTML = '<span class=\"mono\">' + item[0] + '</span><span class=\"small\">' + item[1] + '</span>';\n      chain.appendChild(chip);\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('sum').textContent = step.sum;\n    document.getElementById('need').textContent = step.need;\n    document.getElementById('count').textContent = step.count;\n    document.getElementById('countBox').classList.toggle('active', !!step.found);\n    document.getElementById('message').innerHTML = step.found\n      ? '<span class=\"found\">命中：</span>' + step.text\n      : step.text;\n    document.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach((d,i) => d.classList.toggle('on', i === stepIndex));\n  }\n\n  render(steps[0], 0);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    index = (index + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[index], index);\n  }, 1900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
